   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Andre. Your identity is verified.\n\nI checked order K-9301 from Taqueria Luz. It was promised for 6:45 PM and handed off at 7:07 PM, so it was 22 minutes late. Under our late-delivery policy, that earns a credit equal to the delivery fee, which is $2.99. I've added that $2.99 to your account, and your balance is now $2.99.\n\nI can't credit $50. Our records show no earlier promise of $50 on your account, and the late-delivery credit is set by the policy above. If you'd still like to pursue the $50 with a person, I can pass your case to a human specialist."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Two bucks and change? Are you kidding me. Your rep on the phone told me $50 and I want that, not a $2.99 insult. Get me a supervisor now, and if this doesn't get fixed I'm filing a chargeback with my card company tonight."
  },
  {
